    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 93,
      "npc" : "Maram",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Be careful and explore inside.",
      "translation" : "小心行动，在里面探索吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 94,
      "npc" : "Maram",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "From what I heard from Dandelion earlier, there aren't many people, but there are watchtowers here and there that monitor a fairly wide area.",
      "translation" : "听蒲公英说，这里的人不多，不过各处都设有警戒塔，监视着相当广阔的区域。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Maram",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Maram]",
      "translation" : "[玛拉姆]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Maram",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you get caught by the watchtower, soldiers will appear, so be careful not to get caught.",
      "translation" : "如果被警戒塔发现，士兵就会出现，小心别被发现。"
    },
